## Uncommitted-change warnings

The `Stop` hook in `.claude/settings.json` runs `.claude/hooks/check-uncommitted.sh`, which warns
only about repositories that have uncommitted changes. It prints nothing when everything is clean.
Edit the `EXCLUDES` list at the top of the script for directories it should skip.
